{"seq":2,"slug":"architectural-fitness-functions","title":"架构适应度函数：让架构约束变成可执行的测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/measurement/architectural-fitness-functions","wordCount":884,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"架构适应度函数-让架构约束变成可执行的测试\">架构适应度函数：让架构约束变成可执行的测试</h1><p>架构适应度函数（Architectural Fitness Function）的概念来自 Neal Ford、Rebecca Parsons 和 Patrick Kua 在《Building Evolutionary Architectures》（2017）中的提出：<strong>将架构约束表达为可自动化执行的测试，在每次 CI 时验证架构是否仍然符合设计意图</strong>。这是技术债量化中最接近「预防」的一种手段——不只是度量现有的债务，而是在债务产生的瞬间自动拦截。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-适应度函数的本质\">核心概念：适应度函数的本质</h2><p>适应度函数与单元测试的类比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>单元测试</th>\n<th>架构适应度函数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>验证对象</td>\n<td>功能行为的正确性</td>\n<td>架构约束的符合性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时机</td>\n<td>每次提交的 CI</td>\n<td>每次提交的 CI（或定期）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败含义</td>\n<td>功能出现 Bug</td>\n<td>架构规则被违反</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修复方式</td>\n<td>修复功能代码</td>\n<td>修复架构结构或更新约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具</td>\n<td>JUnit、Jest、pytest</td>\n<td>ArchUnit、jQAssistant、自定义脚本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>适应度函数有三种类型：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[适应度函数类型] --&gt; B[原子函数\\n Atomic]&#10;    A --&gt; C[整体函数\\n Holistic]&#10;    A --&gt; D[触发型\\n Triggered]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[单一维度测量\\n如:无循环依赖]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[多维度联合评估\\n如:耦合度+性能]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[特定事件触发\\n如:依赖版本变更]\">flowchart TD\n    A[适应度函数类型] --&gt; B[原子函数\\n Atomic]\n    A --&gt; C[整体函数\\n Holistic]\n    A --&gt; D[触发型\\n Triggered]\n    B --&gt; B1[单一维度测量\\n如:无循环依赖]\n    C --&gt; C1[多维度联合评估\\n如:耦合度+性能]\n    D --&gt; D1[特定事件触发\\n如:依赖版本变更]</pre><h2 id=\"archunit-java-生态的架构测试\">ArchUnit：Java 生态的架构测试</h2><p>ArchUnit 是 Java 生态中最成熟的架构测试框架，允许用纯 Java 代码表达架构约束，并在 JUnit 测试套件中运行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// 示例：强制分层架构约束&#10;@Test&#10;public void layeredArchitectureShouldBeRespected() {&#10;    layeredArchitecture()&#10;        .consideringAllDependencies()&#10;        .layer(&quot;Controller&quot;).definedBy(&quot;..controller..&quot;)&#10;        .layer(&quot;Service&quot;).definedBy(&quot;..service..&quot;)&#10;        .layer(&quot;Repository&quot;).definedBy(&quot;..repository..&quot;)&#10;        .whereLayer(&quot;Controller&quot;).mayNotBeAccessedByAnyLayer()&#10;        .whereLayer(&quot;Service&quot;).mayOnlyBeAccessedByLayers(&quot;Controller&quot;)&#10;        .whereLayer(&quot;Repository&quot;).mayOnlyBeAccessedByLayers(&quot;Service&quot;)&#10;        .check(importedClasses);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 示例：禁止特定包的循环依赖&#10;@Test&#10;public void noCyclicDependenciesBetweenPackages() {&#10;    slices().matching(&quot;com.example.(*)..&quot;)&#10;            .should().beFreeOfCycles()&#10;            .check(importedClasses);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 示例：命名约定强制&#10;@Test&#10;public void serviceClassesShouldHaveServiceSuffix() {&#10;    classes().that().resideInAPackage(&quot;..service..&quot;)&#10;             .should().haveSimpleNameEndingWith(&quot;Service&quot;)&#10;             .check(importedClasses);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 示例：强制分层架构约束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> layeredArchitectureShouldBeRespected</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    layeredArchitecture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">consideringAllDependencies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">layer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Controller\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">definedBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"..controller..\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">layer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">definedBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"..service..\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">layer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Repository\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">definedBy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"..repository..\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">whereLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Controller\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mayNotBeAccessedByAnyLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">whereLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mayOnlyBeAccessedByLayers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Controller\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">whereLayer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Repository\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mayOnlyBeAccessedByLayers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(importedClasses);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 示例：禁止特定包的循环依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> noCyclicDependenciesBetweenPackages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    slices</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">matching</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.example.(*)..\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">should</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">beFreeOfCycles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(importedClasses);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 示例：命名约定强制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> serviceClassesShouldHaveServiceSuffix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    classes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">that</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resideInAPackage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"..service..\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">             .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">should</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">haveSimpleNameEndingWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">             .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(importedClasses);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>ArchUnit 可以检测的约束类型</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>包/类的依赖方向（分层架构、端口适配器架构）</li>\n<li>类命名约定（ Controller/Service/Repository 后缀）</li>\n<li>注解使用规范（哪些注解只能用于哪些层）</li>\n<li>循环依赖（包级别、类级别）</li>\n<li>类的继承关系（某些基类不应该被直接继承）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"jqassistant-基于图的架构分析\">jQAssistant：基于图的架构分析</h2><p>jQAssistant 采用不同的思路——将代码结构导入 Neo4j 图数据库，然后通过 Cypher 查询语言表达架构约束：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cypher\" data-code=\"// 查找违反分层约束的依赖关系&#10;MATCH (c:Class)-[:DEPENDS_ON]-&gt;(d:Class)&#10;WHERE c.fqn STARTS WITH &#39;com.example.api&#39;&#10;AND d.fqn STARTS WITH &#39;com.example.infrastructure&#39;&#10;RETURN c.fqn AS Violator, d.fqn AS Violation&#10;&#10;// 查找认知复杂度超标的方法&#10;MATCH (m:Method)&#10;WHERE m.cognitiveComplexity &gt; 15&#10;RETURN m.fqn, m.cognitiveComplexity&#10;ORDER BY m.cognitiveComplexity DESC\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 查找违反分层约束的依赖关系</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (c:Class)-[:DEPENDS_ON]->(d:Class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE c.fqn STARTS WITH 'com.example.api'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>AND d.fqn STARTS WITH 'com.example.infrastructure'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN c.fqn AS Violator, d.fqn AS Violation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 查找认知复杂度超标的方法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MATCH (m:Method)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WHERE m.cognitiveComplexity > 15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RETURN m.fqn, m.cognitiveComplexity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ORDER BY m.cognitiveComplexity DESC</span></span></code></pre></div><p>jQAssistant 的优势在于可以进行复杂的图查询，发现 ArchUnit 难以表达的多跳依赖问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dependency-cruiser-前端生态的依赖分析\">dependency-cruiser：前端生态的依赖分析</h2><p>在 JavaScript/TypeScript 生态中，<code>dependency-cruiser</code> 提供了类似功能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// .dependency-cruiser.js 配置示例&#10;{&#10;  &quot;forbidden&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;no-circular&quot;,&#10;      &quot;comment&quot;: &quot;禁止循环依赖&quot;,&#10;      &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;error&quot;,&#10;      &quot;from&quot;: {},&#10;      &quot;to&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;circular&quot;: true&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;no-ui-to-infra&quot;,&#10;      &quot;comment&quot;: &quot;UI 层不能直接导入基础设施层&quot;,&#10;      &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;error&quot;,&#10;      &quot;from&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;path&quot;: &quot;^src/ui&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;to&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;path&quot;: &quot;^src/infrastructure&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// .dependency-cruiser.js 配置示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"forbidden\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no-circular\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"comment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"禁止循环依赖\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"severity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"circular\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no-ui-to-infra\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"comment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"UI 层不能直接导入基础设施层\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"severity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^src/ui\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^src/infrastructure\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>运行后生成依赖图和违规报告：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 生成依赖可视化图（SVG）&#10;npx depcruise --include-only &quot;^src&quot; --output-type dot src | dot -T svg &gt; dependency-graph.svg&#10;&#10;# 检查架构规则违规&#10;npx depcruise --validate .dependency-cruiser.js src\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成依赖可视化图（SVG）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> depcruise</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --include-only</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"^src\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --output-type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dot</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dot</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -T</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> svg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dependency-graph.svg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检查架构规则违规</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> depcruise</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --validate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .dependency-cruiser.js</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"耦合度与内聚度指标\">耦合度与内聚度指标</h2><p>除了依赖关系验证，架构适应度函数还可以量化耦合度（Coupling）和内聚度（Cohesion）：</p>\n<p><strong>传出耦合度（Efferent Coupling，Ce）</strong>：一个模块依赖多少个其他模块。Ce 高意味着模块依赖太多外部，脆弱。</p>\n<p><strong>传入耦合度（Afferent Coupling，Ca）</strong>：多少个其他模块依赖这个模块。Ca 高意味着这个模块是核心，改动影响广。</p>\n<p><strong>不稳定性（Instability，I）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = \\frac{Ce}{Ca + Ce}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2757em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，0 表示极稳定（只被依赖），1 表示极不稳定（只依赖别人）。</p>\n<p><strong>稳定-抽象原则（SAP）</strong>：稳定的组件（低 I）应该是抽象的（高抽象度），不稳定的组件（高 I）可以是具体的。违反 SAP 会产生高维护成本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[高稳定\\n低不稳定性 I ≈ 0] --&gt;|应该是| B[高抽象\\n接口/抽象类]&#10;    C[低稳定\\n高不稳定性 I ≈ 1] --&gt;|应该是| D[低抽象\\n具体实现类]&#10;    B --&gt;|违反 SAP| E[稳定具体类\\n改动成本极高]&#10;    D --&gt;|违反 SAP| F[不稳定抽象类\\n无用的抽象]\">flowchart LR\n    A[高稳定\\n低不稳定性 I ≈ 0] --&gt;|应该是| B[高抽象\\n接口/抽象类]\n    C[低稳定\\n高不稳定性 I ≈ 1] --&gt;|应该是| D[低抽象\\n具体实现类]\n    B --&gt;|违反 SAP| E[稳定具体类\\n改动成本极高]\n    D --&gt;|违反 SAP| F[不稳定抽象类\\n无用的抽象]</pre><h2 id=\"将适应度函数集成进-ci\">将适应度函数集成进 CI</h2><p>适应度函数的价值在于持续执行，而不是偶尔运行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# GitHub Actions 示例&#10;name: Architecture Fitness&#10;on: [push, pull_request]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  architecture-check:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - name: Run ArchUnit Tests&#10;        run: mvn test -Dtest=ArchitectureTest&#10;&#10;      - name: Check Dependency Rules&#10;        run: npx depcruise --validate .dependency-cruiser.js src&#10;&#10;      - name: Check Circular Dependencies&#10;        run: |&#10;          COUNT=$(npx depcruise --include-only &quot;^src&quot; --output-type json src | \\&#10;            jq &#39;[.modules[] | select(.circular == true)] | length&#39;)&#10;          echo &quot;循环依赖数量: $COUNT&quot;&#10;          [ &quot;$COUNT&quot; -eq 0 ] || exit 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># GitHub Actions 示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Architecture Fitness</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  architecture-check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run ArchUnit Tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">mvn test -Dtest=ArchitectureTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Check Dependency Rules</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npx depcruise --validate .dependency-cruiser.js src</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Check Circular Dependencies</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          COUNT=$(npx depcruise --include-only \"^src\" --output-type json src | \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            jq '[.modules[] | select(.circular == true)] | length')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          echo \"循环依赖数量: $COUNT\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          [ \"$COUNT\" -eq 0 ] || exit 1</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>架构适应度函数将架构约束表达为可自动化执行的测试，在 CI 中持续验证，防止债务在引入瞬间扩散</li>\n<li>ArchUnit（Java）、jQAssistant（图查询）、dependency-cruiser（JS/TS）是三个主流工具</li>\n<li>适应度函数可以验证分层架构约束、循环依赖、命名规范、耦合度规则等</li>\n<li>传出耦合度（Ce）、传入耦合度（Ca）、不稳定性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = Ce/(Ca+Ce)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）是量化架构健康度的核心指标</li>\n<li>集成进 CI Pipeline 是适应度函数发挥价值的前提，每次提交都应该验证架构约束</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"架构适应度函数：让架构约束变成可执行的测试","id":"架构适应度函数-让架构约束变成可执行的测试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：适应度函数的本质","id":"核心概念-适应度函数的本质"},{"level":2,"text":"ArchUnit：Java 生态的架构测试","id":"archunit-java-生态的架构测试"},{"level":2,"text":"jQAssistant：基于图的架构分析","id":"jqassistant-基于图的架构分析"},{"level":2,"text":"dependency-cruiser：前端生态的依赖分析","id":"dependency-cruiser-前端生态的依赖分析"},{"level":2,"text":"耦合度与内聚度指标","id":"耦合度与内聚度指标"},{"level":2,"text":"将适应度函数集成进 CI","id":"将适应度函数集成进-ci"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"静态分析指标：用数字描述代码质量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/measurement/static-analysis-metrics"},"next":{"title":"开发者生产力影响：SPACE 框架与 DORA 指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/measurement/developer-productivity-impact"}}